{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S09把X中“还是只想在难受的时候有人陪着”改成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，对人物动机作了更强的推断，削弱了原本尚未确定的心理状态。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过逐行交替、关键词加亮和感受随音乐乐句出现，让观众更容易在听音乐的同时抓住每段重点，也更容易感知情绪如何发生变化。它对音乐细节的描写更具体，音乐意象的反复出现也加强了前后呼应，使整首曲子的心理发展更像一条连续的过程。不过，X在人物动机的解释上有时更完整、更审慎，保留了人物内心尚未想清楚的部分，这一点比Y好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2fc34b8e-b232-460c-bf72-035fcee06cd8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T001133745295Z", "elapsed_seconds": 87.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:13:01.375092+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c9369080e258ec67f34260678cb5e866b5fc5cbce82cbfb2edcc3d140ac413f7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_att